#: guidance-power-manager.py:1033
msgid "About"
msgstr "Över"

#: guidance-power-manager.py:1049 guidance-power-manager.py:1121 ui.py:3
msgid "Guidance Power Manager"
msgstr "\"Guidance\"-Stroompleger"

#: guidance-power-manager.py:1123
msgid "Applet for battery info and setting brightness"
msgstr "Lüttprogramm för Batterie-Info un Helligkeit-Instellen"

#: guidance-power-manager.py:1125
msgid "Copyright 2006-2008 Sebastian Kügler, Canonical Ltd, Luka Renko"
msgstr "Copyright 2006-2008 Sebastian Kügler, Canonical Ltd, Luka Renko"

#: guidance-power-manager.py:1126
msgid "none"
msgstr "keen"

#: ui.py:6
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Allgemeen Instellen"

#: ui.py:9
msgid "Lock screen on resume"
msgstr "Schirm bi't Wiedermaken afsluten"

#: ui.py:12
msgid "Mains Powered"
msgstr "Nettstroombedrief"

#: ui.py:15 ui.py:36
msgid "Brightness"
msgstr "Helligkeit"

#: ui.py:18
msgid ""
"With this slider you can set the brightness when the system is plugged into "
"the socket outlet"
msgstr "Mit dissen Schuver lett sik de Helligkeit instellen, wenn dat Systeem na't Stroomnett tokoppelt is."

#: ui.py:21 ui.py:42
msgid "When the system is idle for more than"
msgstr "Ahn Systeemaktiviteet för mehr as"

#: ui.py:24 ui.py:48 ui.py:54
msgid ""
"To prevent data loss or other damage, you can have the system suspend or "
"hibernate, so you don't run accidentally out of battery power. Configure the "
"number of minutes below which the machine will run the configured action."
msgstr "Dat Systeem lett sik för't Verhöden vun Datenverlust oder anner Schadens utsetten oder infreren, dormit de Batterie nich ut Versehn leddig warrt. Nerrn laat sik de Minuten fastleggen, na de de Reekner de fastleggt Akschoon utföhrt."

#: ui.py:27 ui.py:51 ui.py:57
msgid " min"
msgstr " Min."

#: ui.py:30 ui.py:60
msgid "CPU frequency scaling policy"
msgstr "Regeln för CPU-Frequenztopassen"

#: ui.py:33
msgid "Battery Powered"
msgstr "Batteriebedrief"

#: ui.py:39
msgid "This slider controls the brightness when the system runs on batteries"
msgstr "Disse Schuver stüert de Helligkeit, wenn dat Systeem mit Batterien löppt."

#: ui.py:45
msgid "When battery remaining time drops below"
msgstr "Wenn de överbleven Batterielooptiet weniger warrt as"

#: ui.py:63
msgid "When Laptop Lid Closed"
msgstr "Wenn Klappreeknerdeckel tomaakt"

#: ui.py:69
msgid "Lock screen"
msgstr "Schirm afsluten"

#: ui.py:72
msgid "Suspend to Memory"
msgstr "Utsetten (RAM)"

#: ui.py:75
msgid ""
"Suspend is a sleep state, the system will consume only very little energy "
"when suspended"
msgstr "\"Utsetten\" is en Slaaptostand, in den dat Systeem bi't Utsetten bloots bannig wenig Stroom bruukt."

#: ui.py:81
msgid "Suspend to Disk"
msgstr "Infreren (op Fastplaat)"

#: ui.py:84
msgid ""
"Hibernate or \"Suspend to Disk\" is a deep sleepstate, allowing the system "
"to power off completely"
msgstr "\"Infreren (op Fastplaat)\" is en deep Slaaptostand, in den sik dat Systeem kumplett utmaken lett."

#: ui.py:90
msgid "Halt the machine"
msgstr "Reekner utmaken"

